:: Museum Liquor
<<effects>>

<<set $winterHint to "notGiven">>
<<if $museumAntiqueJournalHints.includes("antiqueliquor")>>
	<<run $museumAntiqueJournalHints.delete("antiqueliquor")>>
<</if>>

<<npc Winter>><<person1>>""Back when this town was just getting started, wine was its primary export. It's what let it find its footing," Winter explains. "Frankly, I'm surprised a bottle has managed to survive until now."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Museum]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

