:: Museum Gold Bullion
<<effects>>

<<set $winterHint to "notGiven">>
<<if $museumAntiqueJournalHints.includes("antiquebullion")>>
	<<run $museumAntiqueJournalHints.delete("antiquebullion")>>
<</if>>

<<npc Winter>><<person1>>"What's this crusty old bar?" Winter asks. <<He>> grabs a rag and rubs the crust from the surface revealing a shiny glint. "It looks to be a bar of gold, surely this would have fetched quite the price, were it not degraded to this point."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Museum]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
