:: Museum Spanish Real
<<effects>>

<<set $winterHint to "notGiven">>
<<if $museumAntiqueJournalHints.includes("antiquereal")>>
	<<run $museumAntiqueJournalHints.delete("antiquereal")>>
<</if>>

<<npc Winter>><<person1>>"Hmm what are these coins?" Winter asks. <<He>> spends a few minutes inspecting the coins before returning. "They seem to read, 'CAROLVS ET IOHANA REGES'. That would seem to date these in the early 15th century under the rule of King Charles I."
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Museum]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

