<</if>>

<<npc Winter>><<person1>>"Powder?" Winter asks confused. <<He>> removes a pair of glasses from under the counter and inspects the bottle closely. "It looks to be an old sealed bottle of indigo. Even nowadays natural indigo is rare so this seems like quite the find."
<br><br>

